+
+## Falsifiability
+
+The two behavioural scenarios are genuinely falsifiable: a happy-dom probe confirms a node held before
+an `innerHTML` rebuild is detached afterwards (`held !== re-queried`, `isConnected === false`), while
+in-place mutation keeps the same node (`held === re-queried`, `isConnected === true`). So both the
+behavioural scenarios and the `@conformance` guard redden against a defective re-rendering build and
+go green only when the seam mutates in place.
 
